abstract: >-
  Experimental research code and paired benchmark results for gradient-aware
  selection of stochastic training environments, including structured
  MLP/CNN studies, a 40-pair CIFAR-10/ResNet-20 validation, RNG candidate
  compression, and prospective representation-geometry diagnostics.
